    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a> for the given delegate <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的委托 <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"ConvertingPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping.model\"><code>ConvertingPropertyAccessor</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given value for the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> pointed to by the given <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>\nconsidering the given <a href=\"../AccessOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>设置指定值，该属性由给定的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>指向，并考虑给定的<a href=\"../AccessOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
