    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> that potentially converts the value handed to\n<a href=\"#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> to the type of the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> using a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>. Exposes <a href=\"#getProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperty(PersistentProperty, Class)</code></a> to allow obtaining the value of a\nproperty in a type the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> can convert the raw type to.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyAccessor</code></a> 可能会将传递给 <a href=\"#setProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Object)\"><code>setProperty(PersistentProperty, Object)</code></a> 的值转换为与 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 类型匹配的类型，该转换通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 实现。它提供 <a href=\"#getProperty(org.springframework.data.mapping.PersistentProperty,java.lang.Class)\"><code>getProperty(PersistentProperty, Class)</code></a> 方法，允许获取属性的值，该值可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 能够将原始类型转换为目标类型的任何类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given value for the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> pointed to by the given <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>设置指定值，该属性由给定的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>指向。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> to the given value. Will do type conversion if a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> is configured.",
      "translation": "将给定的 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 设置为给定值。如果配置了 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.convert 中的类或接口\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>，则执行类型转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the given value for the <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> pointed to by the given <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>.\nThe lookup of intermediate values must not yield null.",
      "translation": "为给定的<a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>设置指定值，该属性由给定的<a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>指向。\n查找中间值时不得返回 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the value of the given <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> potentially applying type conversion to the given target\ntype. The default implementation will not attempt any conversion and reject a type mismatch with a\n<a href=\"../MappingException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>MappingException</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回给定 <a href=\"../PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 的值，并可能将其转换为指定的目标类型。默认实现不会尝试任何转换，若发生类型不匹配，则会抛出 <a href=\"../MappingException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>MappingException</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the value pointed to by the given <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a>. If the given path is empty, the wrapped\nbean is returned. On each path segment value lookup, the resulting value is post-processed depending on the given\n<a href=\"../AccessOptions.GetOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions.GetOptions</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回由给定 <a href=\"../PersistentPropertyPath.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentPropertyPath</code></a> 指向的值。如果给定的路径为空，则返回包装的 bean。在每次路径段值查找时，根据给定的 <a href=\"../AccessOptions.GetOptions.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>AccessOptions.GetOptions</code></a> 对结果进行后处理。",
      "count": 1
    },
